OK that's done. It led to a slight change in behavior -- now if you give it an unknown component/feature, it just returns a nearly empty response like:
```
{
    "cluster_name": "elasticsearch",
    "components": {}
}
```
rather than throwing an error. I'm not really sure which is preferable, and could make an argument in either direction, which is why I didn't add code to throw an error now.

