+
+[[bug-8.1.2]]
+[float]
+=== Bug fixes
+
+Authorization::
+* Add delete privilege to `kibana_system` for APM {es-pull}85085[#85085]
+
+Engine::
+* Increase store ref before snapshotting index commit {es-pull}84776[#84776]
